+#!/bin/sh
+# Builds smallpt.cpp -> smallpt/smallpt.js + smallpt/smallpt.wasm (ES module for a Web Worker).
+set -e
+cd "$(dirname "$0")/.."
+# (No -flto: single translation unit, and the distro toolchain fails LTO libc++ links.)
+em++ -c wasm/smallpt.cpp -o wasm/smallpt.o -O3 -Werror -Wall
+em++ wasm/smallpt.o -o smallpt/smallpt.js \
+  -O3 \
+  -sSTRICT \
+  -sEXPORT_ES6 \
+  -sENVIRONMENT=worker \
+  -sALLOW_MEMORY_GROWTH \
+  -sSTACK_SIZE=4MB \
+  -sEXPORTED_FUNCTIONS=_begin_render,_render_pass,_set_sphere_color,_reset_scene \
+  -sEXPORTED_RUNTIME_METHODS=HEAPU8
