+## smallpt (WebAssembly path tracer)
+
+The homepage renders [smallpt](http://www.kevinbeason.com/smallpt/) in the browser: Kevin Beason's path tracer, compiled to WebAssembly.
+
+- `wasm/smallpt.cpp`: the original smallpt source. Its `main()` is replaced by a small exported API: `render_begin`, `render_row` (progressive passes) and `set_sphere_color`.
