+ *            POST /v1/brewer  {host,port,model,firmware}
+ *            POST /v1/timer   {seconds, label}
+ *
+ * Security notes:
+ *   - Requests are only sent after an explicit click. Nothing is auto-discovered or scanned.
+ *   - The brewer target must be a private IPv4 address or a ".local" mDNS name, and the helper is
+ *     always 127.0.0.1. That way this page can't be used to send requests to arbitrary hosts.
+ *   - Cookies/credentials are never sent (credentials: "omit") and redirects are rejected, so a
