+/*
+ * Seasonal Favorites: reorder, remove, and customize drink cards.
+ *
+ * All motion uses the Web Animations API with FLIP (First, Last, Invert,
+ * Play). This is a deliberate choice over `document.startViewTransition()`:
+ * a document-level view transition snapshots the whole page, blocks pointer
+ * input on it (the sticky nav included) and allows only one transition at a
+ * time. Here every animation belongs to a single element of this component:
+ *   - `translate` for layout moves (grid cards, add-on chips)
+ *   - `height`    for a card or the grid growing or shrinking
+ *   - `opacity` / `scale` for elements entering and leaving
+ * Each one uses a separate CSS property, so they stack and run at the same
+ * time. Several cards can animate at once, and an animation that gets
+ * interrupted picks up from where the element currently is on screen.
+ */
