+/*
+ * seasonal-favorites.js — renders the Seasonal Favorites cards from HTML
+ * strings. Every string is routed through SafeHTML (allowlist sanitizer +
+ * Trusted Types), so markup coming from a CMS, API or editor cannot inject
+ * script, event handlers, or javascript: URLs into the page.
